% extracted paradigms, classes induced from them). Review before relying on it.
%
% Sources (document id in the DocumentCatalog):
%   doc 69334: Topics in the grammar of Kuot: a non-Austronesian language of New Ireland, Papua New Guine (2002), pages 159, 174, 175, 177, 178, 179, 180, 181, 182, 183, 184, 185, 188, 189, 190, 193, 219, 235
